        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"b5ba199a-4757-490a-84f7-6749d44d6c10\",\"review_text\":\"App butut gw puter lagu yang gw like malah yang keluar yang enggak\"},{\"review_id\":\"9d50d0f8-8d92-41b2-9189-cf61b78ac3f8\",\"review_text\":\"wonderful !! Love this soothing 🎶\"},{\"review_id\":\"8e916af9-26c7-4e9c-8adf-2c905e129680\",\"review_text\":\"When ever I go on a song it would go on a different song then the one I played\"},{\"review_id\":\"db9f4905-911b-4b21-be81-e766f6835a5b\",\"review_text\":\"It's hard to discover music on Spotify. It's expensive for what it offers. There are better options out there.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b3bba973-2726-42f9-b608-569b672af5ab\",\"review_text\":\"Easily the greediest app I've ever seen.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f0171f12-9b8e-4835-adf3-a421484c9f0d\",\"review_text\":\"Why did you remove the alphabet slider? Now I have to scroll to where the song is instead of just using it to find the letter. I hate this app. Why would you make the \\\"enhance\\\" feature add the same songs that are already in my list? This app is awful. Hire new developers.\"},{\"review_id\":\"97636902-aeb6-434e-b233-a6a5a5e23a7c\",\"review_text\":\"Ye app bar bar mujhko garebi ki ahsaas deta hai🙂🙂\"},{\"review_id\":\"70839489-890d-4bb8-92db-19161935c4a7\",\"review_text\":\"Wowqq\"},{\"review_id\":\"7636f20c-2924-479d-b679-1b305f0e528c\",\"review_text\":\"super\"},{\"review_id\":\"289efd1e-0a87-4633-ac57-4cef7e79e966\",\"review_text\":\"App does not work properly\"}]}"
